    "body": "Issue sweep: this looks no longer applicable: a later maintainer decision in #2949 replaces this plan. PR #2293 (#2282) moved `BUILTINS` and `MACHINES` to `crates/app/src/posting_files.rs` and added `camcraft_post::data_dir`. PR #2414 (#2380) added `camcraft_post::data_scan` so the lists follow the asset folders. Issue #2949 (`P4`) deletes `BUILTINS` and `MACHINES` and moves post roles into the asset files. Moving the static tables into `camcraft-post` conflicts with #2949. The 8 test files from #919 still remain in `crates/app/tests/`. The maintainer decides whether to close it.\n",
